{"unit_id":"FablerTan__dsh-qq-relay#feature-1","repo":"FablerTan/dsh-qq-relay","commit":"26c00fa5aa4c1faa53aead87e15e0d67a6d90d37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-relay 的功能「群消息接入」：QQ 群消息通过 OneBot 事件进入插件；白名单、去重和媒体处理后，直通消息或闸门判定通过的批次会送入对应 DSH 会话并回传回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/controller/relay.js:1302-1333","lib/controller/relay.js:399-407"]}
